  "body": "The [delete room admin API](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/develop/docs/admin_api/rooms.md#delete-room-api) covers all of the functionality of the [shutdown room admin API](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/develop/docs/admin_api/shutdown_room.md) and more.\r\n\r\nInstead of having two endpoints that do roughly the same thing, we should deprecate the less useful one.\r\n\r\nA deprecation warning will need to go out in the changelog, to allow people to update their third-party code before we eventually remove the API altogether.",
